    </degreeDatas>
    <conflictingTraits>
      <li>HYPSR03JustMoreWonders</li>
      <li>HYPN01FinelyCrafted</li>
      <li>HYPSR13SoManyIdea</li>
      <li>HYPSSR02RuthlessWorkMachine</li>
      <li>HYPSSR05TheUltimateBricklayer</li>
      <li>HYPSSR06BloodthirstyViking</li>
      <li>HYPSSR07FieldSniper</li>
      <li>HYPSSR10YuZuSoftFan</li>
      <li>HYPSSR14ArtZoneDivision</li>
      <li>HYPSSR15MasterOfNegotiations</li>
      <li>HYPUR03TheDealWithLucifer</li>
      <li>HYPSSR13FirearmsExpert</li>
    </conflictingTraits>
    <requiredWorkTags>
      <li>Animals</li>
    </requiredWorkTags>
  </TraitDef>

  <TraitDef>
    <defName>HYPSSR13FirearmsExpert</defName><!-- 枪械专家 -->
    <commonality>0.1</commonality>
    <forcedPassions>
      <li>Crafting</li>
      <li>Shooting</li>
    </forcedPassions>
    <degreeDatas>
      <li>
        <label>firearms expert</label>
        <description>{PAWN_nameDef} has been stripping guns since childhood and can rebuild one {PAWN_pronoun} has never seen before, from memory, without a drawing. As an adult {PAWN_pronoun} joined a special operation to "gather information" from an Empire logistics depot, came out with a great many drawings, and put them somewhere nobody has found. What {PAWN_pronoun} designs is never beautiful. It always works, and it inspires {PAWN_objective} the way nothing else does but the firing line.</description>
