      <li>
        <label>crystallized skin</label>
        <description>Something happened to {PAWN_nameDef} out there, and {PAWN_pronoun} has never explained it well. The cells at the surface of {PAWN_possessive} skin now carry crystal, and they answer an impact by choosing what to become — rigid under a blade, yielding under a club, indifferent to fire. It is body armour made of a non-newtonian fluid. It also catches the light, and the colony has noticed.</description>
