      <li>
        <label>leek harvester</label>
        <description>In the markets of the urbworlds they call the small investors leeks, because they grow back after every cut. {PAWN_nameDef} harvested them by the field, and when that market closed {PAWN_pronoun} moved on to the tax that stupidity pays, which never closes at all. {PAWN_pronoun} is genuinely good with a crop and genuinely good with a mark. {PAWN_pronoun} will not carry anything heavy, fight anyone, or do anything {PAWN_pronoun} considers beneath {PAWN_objective}.</description>
